WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:03.347
- Get this, first I call her to say,

00:00:03.347 --> 00:00:04.650
"Honey where are you?"

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:06.950
'cause I found out I was
not gonna be dancing again.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:09.350
So I said, "Honey where
are you right now?"

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:11.810
She said, "I'm sitting on
the runway in the plane,

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:14.280
we're about to take off
to come cheer you on."

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.160
I said, "Well I need you to save the day."

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:18.360
And she said...

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:19.417
- I said, "No way".

00:00:19.417 --> 00:00:20.250
(audience laughs)

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:22.260
I said, I was,
- Are you insane?

00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:24.030
The whole thing was
that I was on the plane.

00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:25.920
I had found out that
she had broken her arm,

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:27.510
and I was like I'm still gonna come.

00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:30.000
I'm gonna be there to
support her and I'm gonna

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.250
be there to take her to the
hospital and everything.

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:34.820
And I'm flying in, I'm on
the plane about to take off,

00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:38.167
like wheels are moving and
she calls me and she goes,

00:00:38.167 --> 00:00:40.735
"Sailor, I found the silver lining."

00:00:40.735 --> 00:00:41.568
(audience laughs)

00:00:41.568 --> 00:00:42.626
Don't I do a good

00:00:42.626 --> 00:00:43.459
Christie Brinkley voice?
- Yes, you do a

00:00:43.459 --> 00:00:44.292
really good, yes.

00:00:44.292 --> 00:00:46.360
- She goes, "Sailor I
found the silver lining."

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:49.045
I was like, "What you
need me to stop at CVS?

00:00:49.045 --> 00:00:51.577
"Like do you need anything,
anything from home,

00:00:51.577 --> 00:00:53.260
"like bring the dog maybe?"

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:55.560
And she's like, "No, you should go on

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:56.847
Dancing With The Stars."

00:00:58.140 --> 00:00:58.973
(laughing)

00:00:58.973 --> 00:01:00.550
And I was like, "No."

00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:02.710
I had spend the summer like
chilling with my boyfriend,

00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:05.054
and my dog in the Hamptons,
like just sort of like

00:01:05.054 --> 00:01:06.854
being very low key.
- [Kelly] I want your life.

00:01:06.854 --> 00:01:08.684
(laughing)

00:01:08.684 --> 00:01:10.020
Who ultimately came up
with the idea though?

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:11.863
Who, was that you?
- I think it was her.

00:01:11.863 --> 00:01:13.670
- But everybody kind of
came up with the idea

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:15.400
at the same time cause I like,

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:17.120
when something really bad happens

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:19.030
you gotta find the silver lining right?

00:01:19.030 --> 00:01:21.410
And I thought, and you
know, It's "Up Town Girl",

00:01:21.410 --> 00:01:24.130
I mean that's like my theme
song ever since you know.

00:01:24.130 --> 00:01:25.670
It can't just like be anybody.

00:01:25.670 --> 00:01:27.170
It's gotta be one of my girls.

